WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:04.118
Want to understand the Arabic you hear every day, and speak it back?

2
00:00:04.468 --> 00:00:05.979
[Rafiq] Here's how رَفِيق works.

3
00:00:06.429 --> 00:00:11.305
One path: a reading starter, then twelve units, from greetings to hobbies.

4
00:00:11.755 --> 00:00:17.089
Meet new words, hear a conversation, learn one grammar idea, practise, then speak.

5
00:00:17.540 --> 00:00:23.118
In the early units, you build sentences from word tiles. Later on, you type them yourself.

6
00:00:23.718 --> 00:00:30.068
[Rafiq] And رَفِيق brings every word back for review: after a day, then two, four, eight, so it sticks.

7
00:00:30.518 --> 00:00:34.200
Want something specific? Step off the path, into Practise.

8
00:00:34.650 --> 00:00:40.223
Drill twenty-one common verbs in three tenses, and the joining words that link your ideas.

9
00:00:41.123 --> 00:00:44.473
Or play the spelling bee: hear a word, then spell it in Arabic.

10
00:00:44.823 --> 00:00:45.895
كِتاب — book

11
00:00:48.495 --> 00:00:52.721
Go further with Complete: real-life scenes, from the airport to the masjid.

12
00:00:53.221 --> 00:00:56.611
السَّلامُ عَلَيْكُمْ. أَنا جارُكَ الْجَدِيدُ. — Peace be upon you. I'm your new neighbour.

13
00:00:57.011 --> 00:01:04.147
[Rafiq] Type your own replies, and رَفِيق names the mistake, like mixing up masculine and feminine, then helps you fix it.

14
00:01:04.747 --> 00:01:07.784
And get a review built from the mistakes you keep making.

15
00:01:08.384 --> 00:01:12.796
One path to follow, and practice whenever you want more. A few minutes a day.

16
00:01:13.195 --> 00:01:17.096
[Rafiq] Start your first lesson free at rafiq-arabic.com.
